docs {
Pengajuan jadi verifikator (20-api-verifier-application.md).
Login contributor. Body: full_name + phone + address (min 10) + social_links min 1
(platform + username + screenshot) + reason (min 10).
Dialek tidak dikirim; server menyimpan umum.
Foto (`photo`) opsional. Butuh minimal 3 kontribusi disetujui
(403 VERIFIER_CONTRIBUTIONS_TOO_FEW).

201 sukses (baris baru, status pending). 409 APPLICATION_ALREADY_EXISTS
jika sudah pernah apply. 403 ALREADY_VERIFIER jika bukan contributor.
409 PHONE_ALREADY_EXISTS jika HP dipakai user lain.
}

meta {
  name: Create Verifier Application
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/verifier-applications
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{contributor_access_token}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
    "phone": "81234567890",
    "address": "Jl. Merdeka No. 1, Sambas, Kalimantan Barat",
    "social_links": [
      {
        "platform": "instagram",
        "username": "budi",
        "screenshot": {
          "url": "https://ik.imagekit.io/test/verifier-applications/budi.jpg",
          "provider_file_id": "file_va_budi"
        }
      }
    ],
    "reason": "Saya ingin meninjau kata."
  }
}

tests {
  test("201 + pending", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(201);
    expect(res.body.success).to.equal(true);
    expect(res.body.data.status).to.equal("pending");
    expect(res.body.data.phone).to.equal("6281234567890");
    bru.setVar("verifier_application_id", res.body.data.id);
  });
}
